Cell["\"UniformRandom\"", "ExampleSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"6af58388-ce58-af49-a402-39cdea7e03ac"],

Cell["\<\
Uniform-random mode applies a random subset of matches per step via reservoir \
sampling, tracing a single stochastic history rather than the full multiway \
system:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"8ecfb508-b10e-df42-9a2b-f7ce2703a8f9"],

